text.en:
Replace the test with the counter. Global variables: `int voyageurs = 0;`, `char premiere = '-';` (the barrier crossed first) and `unsigned long debut = 0;`. In loop():
- `bool a = digitalRead(2) == LOW;` and `bool b = digitalRead(3) == LOW;`;
- if `premiere == '-'` and a barrier is crossed: `premiere` becomes `'A'` or `'B'`, and `debut = millis();`;
- if `premiere == 'A'` and `b`: `voyageurs++` (an entry); if `premiere == 'B'` and `a`: `voyageurs--` (an exit, never below 0). Print the count to the serial monitor, then `premiere = 'X'`: wait for both barriers to be free before going back to `'-'`;
- no second barrier after **3 s** (`millis() - debut > 3000`): a U-turn, `premiere = '-'`;
- if `voyageurs >= 3` (capacity of the model): LED2 on and LED1 off; otherwise the opposite.
Click “Upload”.
